// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// animal: snake.c
// Jay 3/18/96

inherit NPC;

void create()
{
        set_name("玉蜂", ({ "bee", "yufeng" }) );
        set("race", "野兽");
        set("age", 4);
        set("long", "罕见的大蜜蜂，小龙女所饲，剧毒。\n");
        set("attitude", "peaceful");

        set("str", 20);
        set("cor", 30);

        set("limbs", ({  "身体",  "翅膀" }) );
        set("verbs", ({ "bite" }) );

        set("combat_exp", 1000);

        set_temp("apply/attack", 15);
        set_temp("apply/damage", 3);
        set_temp("apply/armor", 2);

        setup();
}

void init()
{
        object ob;
        ::init();
        if (interactive(ob = this_player()) &&
                random(ob->query_kar() + ob->query_per()) < 30) {
                        remove_call_out("kill_ob");
                        call_out("kill_ob", 1, ob); 
//                        set_leader(ob);
        }
}

void die()
{
        message_vision("$N被你一掌挥落，补上一脚，尸骨全无。\n", this_object());
        destruct(this_object());
}

int hit_ob(object me, object victim, int damage)
{
        victim->apply_condition("snake_poison",
                victim->query_condition("snake_poison") + 20);
        return 0;
}     

int query_autoload() { return 1; }